        <Literature>Zhu L, Chen L, Xu P, et al. Genetic and molecular basis of epilepsy-related cognitive dysfunction. Epilepsy Behav. 2020;104(Pt A):106848. doi:10.1016/j.yebeh.2019.106848</Literature>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>认知障碍</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Diminished or impaired mental and/or intellectual function.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Interference or disruption of cognitive processes. This term encompasses a large number of problems and issues associated with intellectual functioning and information processing. 2005</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
