        <Literature>Bubrick EJ, McDannold NJ, White PJ. Low Intensity Focused Ultrasound for Epilepsy- A New Approach to Neuromodulation. Epilepsy Curr. 2022;22(3):156-160. Published 2022 Mar 29. doi:10.1177/15357597221086111</Literature>
