        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A definite pathologic process with a characteristic set of signs and symptoms. It may affect the whole body or any of its parts, and its etiology, pathology, and prognosis may be known or unknown.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
