    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass0194a7b5_daad_40d8_808d_e4498ae35afa">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClassf3a41382_1ccc_44f0_a16e_e427f6763116"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>基因检测</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Detection of a MUTATION; GENOTYPE; KARYOTYPE; or specific ALLELES associated with genetic traits, heritable diseases, or predisposition to a disease, or that may lead to the disease in descendants. It includes prenatal genetic testing.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>The process of isolating and testing the DNA of an embryo or a person to detect the presence of genetic alterations or defects that may predispose to the future development of a disease or disorder.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
