    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass043b291c_5ce7_4f2d_9ead_d13143ac37d8 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass043b291c_5ce7_4f2d_9ead_d13143ac37d8">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass7d9f4570_b814_4c4b_9d22_de131530c392"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>焦虑障碍的诊断</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Feelings or emotions of dread, apprehension, and impending disaster but not disabling as with ANXIETY DISORDERS.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Apprehension of danger and dread accompanied by restlessness, tension, tachycardia, and dyspnea unattached to a clearly identifiable stimulus.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>anxiety reaction
Feel anxious
