        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>The Epilepsy Surgery Inventory (ESI-55) is an instrument developed by Vickrey to assess QOL in patients with refractory seizures, whether or not they are candidates for surgical treatment.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
