        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A class of drugs that act by inhibition of potassium efflux through cell membranes. Blockade of potassium channels prolongs the duration of ACTION POTENTIALS. They are used as ANTI-ARRHYTHMIA AGENTS and VASODILATOR AGENTS.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
