Benzamide N-(2-piperidinylmethyl)-25-bis(222-trifluoroethoxy)-
(±)-flecainide
Flécanide</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Flecainide</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass317a3cbc_2cd9_4f9b_9088_efda89045d29 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass317a3cbc_2cd9_4f9b_9088_efda89045d29">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass45f108b9_3366_4807_a232_7553176d410d"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性的避孕选择</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Choices for women taking enzyme-inducing  antiseizure medications(备注：参考ISBN 978190910344、https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg137、https://www.rcog.org.uk/en/guidelines-research-services/guidelines/gtg68/、PMID: 25618222)</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>If emergency contraception is required for women and girls taking enzyme-inducing AEDs, the type and dose of emergency contraception should be in line with the SPC and current edition of the BNF.[2004, amended 2012]
如果服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性需要紧急避孕，紧急避孕的类型和剂量应符合 SPC 和 BNF 的当前版本。
All children born to mothers taking enzyme-inducing AEDs should be given 1 mg of vitamin K parenterally at delivery. [2004]
所有服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药物的母亲所生的孩子都应在分娩时肠胃外给予 1 mg 维生素 K。 [2004]
The use of additional barrier methods should be discussed with women and girls taking enzyme-inducing AEDs and oral contraception or having depot injections of progestogen[23].[2004, amended 2012]
应将额外的外用避孕方法的用途告知与服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药和口服避孕药或长期注射孕激素的女性[23]。[2004 年，2012 年修订]
The progestogen[23]implant is not recommended in women and girls taking enzyme-inducing AEDs.[2004, amended 2012]
不建议正在服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性和女孩采用埋植孕激素的方法[23]。[2004 年，2012 年修订]
The progestogen[23]-only pill is not recommended as reliable contraception in women and girls taking enzyme-inducing AEDs.[2004, amended 2012]
不建议将仅含孕激素 [23] 的药作为服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的妇女和女孩的可靠避孕方法。[2004 年，2012 年修订]
If a woman or girl taking enzyme-inducing AEDs chooses to take the combined oral contraceptive pill, guidance about dosage should be sought from the SPC and current edition of the BNF.[2004, amended 2012]
如果有服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性决定使用短效复方口服避孕药，则应从 SPC 和当前版本的 BNF 寻求有关剂量的指导
nice.org.uk/guidance/cg137</untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:C] WWE taking enzyme-inducing AEDs should be informed that a copper IUD is the preferred choice for emergency contraception. Emergency contraception pills with levonorgestrel and ulipristal acetate are affected by enzyme-inducing AEDs.
【推荐等级：C】应告知服用酶诱导AEDs的WWE，铜质宫内节育器是紧急避孕的首选，含左炔诺孕酮和醋酸乌利司他的紧急避孕药会受到酶诱导AEDs的影响。
https://www.rcog.org.uk/guidance/browse-all-guidance/green-top-guidelines/epilepsy-in-pregnancy-green-top-guideline-no-68/</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:C] Women should be counselled that the efficacy of oral contraceptives (combined hormonal contraception, progestogen-only pills), transdermal patches, vaginal ring and progestogen-only implants may be affected if they are taking enzyme-inducing AEDs (e.g. carbamazepine, phenytoin, phenobarbital, primidone, oxcarbazepine and eslicarbazepine).
【推荐等级：C】如果WWE正在服用酶诱导AEDs，应告知患者口服避孕药（联合激素类避孕药、仅含孕激素的药片）、透皮贴片（transdermal patches）、阴道环和仅含孕激素皮下埋植（progestogen-only implants）的疗效会受到影响。</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:C] Women taking enzyme-inducing AEDs (carbamazepine, phenytoin, phenobarbital, primidone, oxcarbazepine, topiramate and eslicarbazepine) should be counselled about the risk of failure with some hormonal contraceptives.
【推荐等级：C】应告知服用酶诱导型AEDs（卡马西平、苯妥英、苯巴比妥、扑米酮、奥卡西平、托吡酯、艾司利卡西平）的WWE避孕失败的风险。
https://www.rcog.org.uk/guidance/browse-all-guidance/green-top-guidelines/epilepsy-in-pregnancy-green-top-guideline-no-68/</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:D] Copper intrauterine devices (IUDs), the levonorgestrel-releasing intrauterine system (LNG-IUS) and medroxyprogesterone acetate injections should be promoted as reliable methods of contraception that are not affected by enzyme-inducing AEDs.
【推荐等级：D】不被酶诱导AEDs影响的避孕措施包括：铜质宫内节育器（Copper intrauterine devices，IUDs）、左炔诺孕酮宫内缓释系统（levonorgestrel-releasing intrauterine system，LNG-IUS）和醋酸甲羟孕酮注射液（medroxyprogesterone acetate）。
https://www.rcog.org.uk/guidance/browse-all-guidance/green-top-guidelines/epilepsy-in-pregnancy-green-top-guideline-no-68/</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:SIGN_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:D]  For women receiving hepatic enzyme-inducing antiepileptic drugs:
D级推荐：对于正在接受肝酶诱导AEDs治疗的妇女：
the levonorgestrel intrauterine system may be used without restriction
曼月乐（左炔诺孕酮宫内节育系统）的使用不受限制；
 depot injections of progestogen may be used without restriction and with no alteration to the normal dosing/replacement interval
定期注射孕激素（depot injections of progestogen）也不受限制，并且可不改变正常剂量和替代间隔（replacement interval）；
progestogen-only oral contraceptives are not recommended
不推荐仅含孕激素的口服避孕药；
progestogen implants (levonorgestrel and etonogestrel) are not recommended
不推荐皮下植入孕激素（左炔诺孕酮和依托诺孕酮）；
  if there is no alternative to a COCP, the COCP should contain at least 50 micrograms daily of oestrogen; if the COCP contains less oestrogen, the woman should be warned that the efficacy is reduced and additional barrier methods should be used
如果没有可替代的COCP，COCP应至少含有50mg的雌激素；如果COCP含有较少剂量的雌激素，应告知患者避孕效果会降低，应使用额外的屏障避孕方法；
  if breakthrough bleeding occurs with a COCP containing 50 micrograms of oestrogen, the COCP dose should be increased to a maximum of 70 micrograms and ‘tricycling’ should be considered
如果使用含有50mg雌激素的COCP发生突破性出血，雌激素的剂量应增加到70mg，并考虑“三环（tricycling）“疗法；
  if the antiepileptic drug is withdrawn, it is important to note that enzyme induction persists for up to four weeks. Contraceptive cover should be ensured during this time.
如果停用AEDs，应注意酶诱导作用将持续4周，在这期间应确保避孕措施的有效性。
Scottish Intercollegiate Guidelines Network.Diagnosis and management of epilepsy in adults. SIGN 143. Edinburgh, SIGN, 2015. Available at: www.sign.ac.uk/guidelines/fulltext/143/index.html</untitled-ontology-34:SIGN_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:SIGN_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:D] Women with epilepsy who require emergency contraception while using enzyme-inducing antiepileptic drugs, or who have stopped taking these within the last 28 days:
D级推荐：正在使用酶诱导AEDs或在过去28天内停用酶诱导AEDs的女性癫痫患者若需要紧急避孕：
  should be prescribed a single dose of levonorgestrel 3 mg (as opposed to 1.5 mg), ideally as soon as possible, and within 72 hours of unprotected intercourse
单次服用左炔诺孕酮3mg（注意不是1.5mg），越快越好，并且最好是在无保护性交后72h内服用；
should not be offered ulipristal acetate (ellaOne®) because of a risk of reduced efficacy
不应采用醋酸利培酮（ulipristal acetate，ellaOne®），因其可降低疗效；
  may be offered insertion of a non-hormonal intrauterine device within 5 days of intercourse as an alternative option.
可在性交后5天内使用非荷尔蒙宫内节育器作为替代选择。
Scottish Intercollegiate Guidelines Network.Diagnosis and management of epilepsy in adults. SIGN 143. Edinburgh, SIGN, 2015. Available at: www.sign.ac.uk/guidelines/fulltext/143/index.html</untitled-ontology-34:SIGN_Guidance>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Choices for women taking enzyme-inducing  antiseizure medications</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass3193642d_95d0_4615_9db1_d3f37ebf09b6 -->

