        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Procedures concerned with the remedial treatment or prevention of diseases.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>If a woman or girl taking enzyme-inducing AEDs chooses to take the combined oral contraceptive pill, guidance about dosage should be sought from the SPC and current edition of the BNF.[2004, amended 2012]
如果有服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性决定使用短效复方口服避孕药，则应从 SPC 和当前版本的 BNF 寻求有关剂量的指导
nice.org.uk/guidance/cg137</untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>
