    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass40f7a5d6_542b_44d6_a331_503d1e3a6203 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass40f7a5d6_542b_44d6_a331_503d1e3a6203">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClassb48e40ef_ec7d_4d11_b80b_59a65cd77456"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>苯二氮卓类</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A group of two-ring heterocyclic compounds consisting of a benzene ring fused to a diazepine ring.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Drugs from this chemical class are used for their central nervous system depressant properties including sedation, facilitation of sleep, seizure control, general anesthesia, anxiolytic, amnestic, and for detoxification from similar (cross tolerant) drugs</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:D] Long-acting benzodiazepines such as clobazam can be considered if there is a very high risk of seizures in the peripartum period.
【推荐等级：D】如果WWE在围产期癫痫发作的风险很高，可以考虑服用长效苯二氮卓类药物，如氯巴占。
[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:CD Seizures in labour should be terminated as soon as possible to avoid maternal and fetal hypoxia and fetal acidosis. Benzodiazepines are the drugs of choice.
【推荐等级：D】应尽快终止生产过程中的癫痫发作，以避免母婴缺氧和胎儿酸中毒。首选苯二氮卓类药物。
https://www.rcog.org.uk/guidance/browse-all-guidance/green-top-guidelines/epilepsy-in-pregnancy-green-top-guideline-no-68/</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>Benzodiazepine
Benzodiazepine (substance)
Benzodiazepine-containing product
Product containing benzodiazepine (product)
Benzodiazepines
BENZODIAZEPINE CPDS
Benzodiazepine Compounds
benzodiazepine
benzodiazepines</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Benzodiazepines</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


