        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>唾液</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>The clear, viscous fluid secreted by the SALIVARY GLANDS and mucous glands of the mouth. It contains MUCINS, water, organic salts, and ptylin.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>The watery fluid in the mouth made by the salivary glands. Saliva moistens food to help digestion and it helps protect the mouth against infections.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>Head and Neck Saliva
