        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>An irreversible inhibitor of monoamine oxidase types A and B that is used as an antidepressive agent. It has also been used as an antitubercular agent, but its use is limited by its toxicity.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
