        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>进行性肌阵挛癫痫</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A heterogeneous group of primarily familial EPILEPSY disorders characterized by myoclonic seizures, tonic-clonic seizures, ataxia, progressive intellectual deterioration, and neuronal degeneration. These include LAFORA DISEASE; MERRF SYNDROME; NEURONAL CEROID-LIPOFUSCINOSIS; sialidosis (see MUCOLIPIDOSES), and UNVERRICHT-LUNDBORG SYNDROME.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>A rare group of disorders characterized by the development of myoclonic and tonic-clonic epileptic seizures associated with progressive degeneration of the nervous system.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
