        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>致畸风险较低的抗癫痫药物</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Antiseizure medications with lower risk of teratogenicity</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>Antiepileptic drugs with  lower risk of teratogenicity</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
