        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>钙通道阻滞剂</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A class of drugs that act by selective inhibition of calcium influx through cellular membranes.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>A pharmaceutical agent that inhibits the movement of calcium across through calcium channels in the cell membrane, preventing or decreasing the amount of calcium able to enter the cell. These drugs are used for their chronotropic, antihypertensive and vasodilatory effects.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
