        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>铋剂</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A metallic element that has the atomic symbol Bi, and atomic number 83. Its principal isotope is Bismuth 209.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
