        <rdfs:comment>对于患有局灶性癫痫的计划怀孕并母乳喂养的女性患者，奥卡西平为首选治疗方案，拉莫三嗪和左乙拉西坦也是治疗选择；卡马西平、拉考沙胺、艾司利卡西平和唑尼沙胺为二线选择。
Lamotrigine and levetiracetam were the treatments of choice, with oxcarbazepine considered first-line treatment. Carbamazepine, lacosamide, eslicarbazepine, and zonisamide were considered second-line options.
Shih JJ, Whitlock JB, Chimato N, Vargas E, Karceski SC, Frank RD. Epilepsy treatment in adults and adolescents: Expert opinion, 2016. Epilepsy Behav. 2017 Apr;69:186-222. doi: 10.1016/j.yebeh.2016.11.018. Epub 2017 Feb 23. PMID: 28237319.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Focal seizures</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


