    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass7321bef1_4819_455d_a101_247030c2089f -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass7321bef1_4819_455d_a101_247030c2089f">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org//Childbearing-ageWomenwithEpilepsyOntology#OWLClass0db655e6_fcdc_45ba_a5c9_4508ac0dd74b"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>皮下埋植剂</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Small containers or pellets of a solid drug implanted in the body to achieve sustained release of the drug.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>A solid intended for insertion securely within the body.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>The progestogen[23]implant is not recommended in women and girls taking enzyme-inducing AEDs.[2004, amended 2012]
不建议正在服用酶诱导型抗癫痫药的女性和女孩采用埋植孕激素的方法[23]。[2004 年，2012 年修订]
nice.org.uk/guidance/cg137</untitled-ontology-34:NICE_guidance>
        <untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>[GRADES OF RECOMMENDATION:C] Women should be counselled that the efficacy of oral contraceptives (combined hormonal contraception, progestogen-only pills), transdermal patches, vaginal ring and progestogen-only implants may be affected if they are taking enzyme-inducing AEDs (e.g. carbamazepine, phenytoin, phenobarbital, primidone, oxcarbazepine and eslicarbazepine).
【推荐等级：C】如果WWE正在服用酶诱导AEDs，应告知患者口服避孕药（联合激素类避孕药、仅含孕激素的药片）、透皮贴片（transdermal patches）、阴道环和仅含孕激素皮下埋植（progestogen-only implants）的疗效会受到影响。
https://www.rcog.org.uk/guidance/browse-all-guidance/green-top-guidelines/epilepsy-in-pregnancy-green-top-guideline-no-68/</untitled-ontology-34:ROCG_Guidance>
