        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>度洛西汀</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A thiophene derivative and selective NEUROTRANSMITTER UPTAKE INHIBITOR for SEROTONIN and NORADRENALINE (SNRI). It is an ANTIDEPRESSIVE AGENT and ANXIOLYTIC, and is also used for the treatment of pain in patients with DIABETES MELLITUS and FIBROMYALGIA.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
