        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A psychological state of awareness, the practices that promote this awareness, a mode of processing information and a character trait. As a therapy mindfulness is defined as a moment-to-moment awareness of one&apos;s experience without judgment and as a state and not a trait.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
