        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>A childhood-onset epilepsy syndrome.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>A syndrome characterized by frequent episodes of epilepsy during childhood. The epileptic episodes may be tonic, atonic, myoclonic, or absence seizures. It may be accompanied by mental retardation and behavioral problems.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
