    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass9a9b42f6_7293_4b6c_8810_62d9b49cf59d -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass9a9b42f6_7293_4b6c_8810_62d9b49cf59d">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass9aada549_0c92_4f7e_9ebc_46695086f493"/>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>抗生素</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Substances produced by microorganisms that can inhibit or suppress the growth of other microorganisms.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Substances naturally produced by microorganisms or their derivatives that selectively target microorganisms not humans. Antibiotics kill or inhibit the growth of microorganisms by targeting components of the microbial cell absent from human cells, including bacterial cell walls, cell membrane, and 30S or 50S ribosomal subunits. These substances are used in the treatment of bacterial and other microbial infections.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>Antibiotic Drugs
antimicrobial
Antibiotic
Antibiotic Therapy
Antibiotic Agents
antibiotics
Antibiotic (product)
Antimicrobial Agent</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Antibiotic</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass9aab4b67_5a67_4f3f_a2b1_1de036752873 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClass9aab4b67_5a67_4f3f_a2b1_1de036752873">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org//Childbearing-ageWomenwithEpilepsyOntology#OWLClassa08bc63f_763f_4752_bdfb_b7bd5e7175e4"/>
        <OWLAnnotationPropertyd448a312_221a_4215_b2b2_684d470bc1f8>China_expert_opinion_2013
月经期癫痫的常规治疗方案应首先确定癫痫发作与月经周期的关系，在每月癫痫发作可能加重的前2-3 d临时增加AEDs剂量，直至癫痫发作情况缓解后2 d再逐渐减至维持剂量；或在此期间加用氯硝西泮。
黄体酮也可作为月经期癫痫的添加治疗。据报道，在每次月经周期的后半阶段肌内注射黄体酮对控制癫痫有一定疗效，而口服无效。如每隔2周连续肌内注射醋酸甲羟孕酮200 mg，共3次，癫痫发作频率可明显减少。但对女性癫痫患者是否接受激素治疗需由生殖、内分泌或妇科专家进行评估。注意接受有肝酶诱导作用的AEDs治疗的癫痫患者需适当增加激素剂量；较大剂量的黄体酮可能影响肝酶对AEDs的代谢。
&quot;关于成人癫痫患者长程管理的专家共识.&quot; 中华神经科杂志 .07(2013):496-499.</OWLAnnotationPropertyd448a312_221a_4215_b2b2_684d470bc1f8>
        <OWLAnnotationPropertyd448a312_221a_4215_b2b2_684d470bc1f8>如果WWE存在生殖内分泌功能异常，医生应考虑检查患者激素水平、盆腔超声或垂体神经成像（pituitary neuroimaging scan）。
If anomalies are detected, doctors should consider hormone level measurements, a pelvic ultrasound study, or a pituitary neuroimaging scan.
Mauri Llerda JA, Suller Marti A, de la Peña Mayor P, Martínez Ferri M, Poza Aldea JJ, Gomez Alonso J, Mercadé Cerdá JM. The Spanish Society of Neurology&apos;s official clinical practice guidelines for epilepsy. Special considerations in epilepsy: comorbidities, women of childbearing age, and elderly patients. Neurologia. 2015 Oct;30(8):510-7. English, Spanish. doi: 10.1016/j.nrl.2014.08.002. Epub 2015 Jan 21. PMID: 25618222

患者应定期随访，记录其临床特征，包括月经周期、不孕不育、体重增加、多毛、溢乳和性功能障碍的情况。
Patients should be asked routinely about their menstrualcycles and any infertility, excessive weight gain, hirsutism, galactorrhoea, or sexual dysfunction.
Mauri Llerda JA, Suller Marti A, de la Peña Mayor P, Martínez Ferri M, Poza Aldea JJ, Gomez Alonso J, Mercadé Cerdá JM. The Spanish Society of Neurology&apos;s official clinical practice guidelines for epilepsy. Special considerations in epilepsy: comorbidities, women of childbearing age, and elderly patients. Neurologia. 2015 Oct;30(8):510-7. English, Spanish. doi: 10.1016/j.nrl.2014.08.002. Epub 2015 Jan 21. PMID: 25618222.</OWLAnnotationPropertyd448a312_221a_4215_b2b2_684d470bc1f8>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>月经周期调整</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Adjustment of menstrual cycle to regular routine 参考ISBN9787117158626</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Adjustment of menstrual cycle</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


