        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>有意识</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>The act of \&quot;taking account\&quot; of an object or state of affairs. It does not imply assessment of, nor attention to the qualities or nature of the object.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Knowing that something exists, or having knowledge or experience of a particular thing; having special interest in or experience of something and so being well informed of what is happening in that subject at the present time.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
