QUEtiapine
Quetiapinum
Quetiapine-containing product
Quetiapina
Product containing quetiapine (medicinal product)</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Quetiapine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


