        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>An adjunctive treatment for PARTIAL EPILEPSY and refractory DEPRESSION that delivers electrical impulses to the brain via the VAGUS NERVE. A battery implanted under the skin supplies the energy.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
