        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>肝功能不全</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Conditions in which the LIVER functions fall below the normal ranges. Severe hepatic insufficiency may cause LIVER FAILURE or DEATH. Treatment may include LIVER TRANSPLANTATION.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>The inability of the liver to perform its normal synthetic and metabolic functions.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>Liver Insufficiency
Liver Failure
Hepatic Insufficiency
Hepatic Failure
