3-(2-chlorophenothiazin-10-yl)-NN-dimethyl-propan-1-amine
N-(3-dimethylaminopropyl)-3-chlorophenothiazine
Clorpromazina</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Chlorpromazine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


