        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Drugs intended for human or veterinary use, presented in their finished dosage form. Included here are materials used in the preparation and/or formulation of the finished dosage form.</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>A drug product that contains one or more active and/or inactive ingredients; it is intended to treat, prevent or alleviate the symptoms of disease. This term does not refer to the individual ingredients that make up the product.</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
