Intrauterine Devices Copper
Copper-containing Intrauterine Device (IUD)
Copper Releasing IUD
IUD Copper-Releasing
IUDs Copper-Releasing
Intrauterine Device Copper
Copper-Releasing IUD
COPPER IUD
Copper Intrauterine Devices
Device Copper Intrauterine
Copper Intrauterine Device</untitled-ontology-34:Synonyms>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">Copper intrauterine devices</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClassd4b22439_d414_4fd4_9721_7d6862b04413 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/administrator/ontologies/2022/0/untitled-ontology-34#OWLClassd4b22439_d414_4fd4_9721_7d6862b04413">
