        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>饮食治疗</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>Adjusting the quantity and quality of food intake to improve health status of an individual. This term does not include the methods of food intake (NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT).</untitled-ontology-34:MESH_Definition>
