        <untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>去甲肾上腺素和特异性5-HT能抗抑郁药</untitled-ontology-34:Chinese>
        <untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>Norepinephrine and specific 5-HT antidepressants 参考https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00370</untitled-ontology-34:NCIt_Definition>
